	</article><article id="firehose-186353504" data-fhid="186353504" data-fhtype="story" class="fhitem fhitem-story article usermode thumbs grid_24">
		<span class="sd-info-block" style="display: none">
			<span class="sd-key-firehose-id">186353504</span>
			<span class="type">story</span>
			
		</span>







	
	

<header>
	
		<span class="topic" id="topic-186353504">
			<a href="//slashdot.org/index2.pl?fhfilter=robot" onclick="return addfhfilter('robot');">
			
				<img src="//a.fsdn.com/sd/topics/robot_64.png" width="64" height="64" alt="Robotics" title="Robotics">
			
		</a>
		</span>
	
    
	<h2 class="story">
		

		

		
		

		

		

		

		<span id="title-186353504" class="story-title"> <a onclick="return toggle_fh_body_wrap_return(this);"  href="//hardware.slashdot.org/story/26/10/17/2247220/woman-arrested-after-blocking-delivery-robot-to-protest-job-displacements">Woman Arrested After Blocking Delivery Robot to Protest Job Displacements </a> <span class=" no extlnk"><a class="story-sourcelnk" href="https://abc13.com/story/woman-arrested-blocking-delivery-robot-philadelphia-confrontation/19943936/"  title="External link - https://abc13.com/story/woman-arrested-blocking-delivery-robot-philadelphia-confrontation/19943936/" target="_blank"> (abc13.com) </a></span></span>

		
		
		<!--<span class="comments commentcnt-186353504" >64</span>-->
		

		
		<!-- comment bubble -->
		
			<span class="comment-bubble"><a href="//hardware.slashdot.org/story/26/10/17/2247220/woman-arrested-after-blocking-delivery-robot-to-protest-job-displacements#comments" title="">64</a></span>
		
	</h2>
	<div class="details" id="details-186353504">
		<span class="story-details">
		<span class="story-views">
			<span class="sodify" onclick="firehose_set_options('color', 'red')" title="Filter Firehose to entries rated red or better"></span><span class="icon-beaker pop1 " alt="Popularity" title="Filter Firehose to entries rated red or better" onclick="firehose_set_options('color', 'red')"><span></span></span> 
		</span>
		</span>
		<span class="story-byline">
	
				
			Posted
				by 
		
		
			
				  EditorDavid
			
		
		

		
		
		<time id="fhtime-186353504" datetime="on Saturday October 17, 2026 @09:34PM">on Saturday October 17, 2026 @09:34PM</time>
		
		
			 from the <span class="dept-text">aye-robot</span> dept.
		
		</span>
	</div>
</header>

<div class="body" id="fhbody-186353504">
	

	
		
		<div id="text-186353504" class="p">
			
		 	
				A <a href="https://abc13.com/story/woman-arrested-blocking-delivery-robot-philadelphia-confrontation/19943936/">Philadelphia newscast</a> reports on a grey-haired lady who allegedly refused to move out of the path of a delivery robot as a form of protest because "I know they're taking the jobs of human delivery workers."<br> <br>

She was arrested, but says her actions were protected speech:

<i>According to police, Marvin repeatedly blocked the robot's path and ignored multiple commands from officers to move...  Marvin said she was protesting the use of delivery robots because she believes they are replacing human workers.... "I have been protesting them whenever I saw them by standing in front of them and preventing them from going forward," Marvin said... <br> <br>

Marvin said she has confronted delivery robots on multiple occasions...  Ashley Baldwin of West Philadelphia said she witnessed one of those encounters.  "I actually thought the robot hit her, so my original question was, 'Are you OK? Did the robot hit you?' And she said, 'No, I have to stop this. They're taking over the world,'" Baldwin said.<br> <br>
Asked whether she plans to continue protesting the robots, Marvin said she does.</i> <br>

She was charged with disorderly conduct.<br> <br>

Uber did not respond to their request for a comment.<br>
		 	
		</div>

		

		

		
	</div>
